	(text
		"10 D1 and D2 sit on RC0 and RC1, not on port A.\n   DS39977C page 541 allows PORTA<5:0> only 2 mA\n   sourced or sunk, against 25 mA on PORTB and\n   PORTC. RA1 and RA2 went to J4 instead.\n11 MCLR carries the full network of DS39977C\n   figure 2-2: R1 10k to +5V, R6 470R in series\n   into pin 1, C8 100n to SGND behind JP2. Pull\n   the JP2 jumper before programming - note 7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
